Phase 886: Ornamental & Medicinal Plant Administration Modules - 3 new WASM application modules:

1. modules/jacaranda_admin/src/main.c (Jacaranda Flowering Tree Administration)
   - Base ID: 2084
   - Manages jacaranda (Jacaranda mimosifolia) ornamental flowering tree cultivation
   - Features: tree inventory (16 trees), growth tracking, flower bloom monitoring, seed collection records, pruning schedule, pest/disease management, landscape planting records, wood quality assessment
   - Domain structs: jacaranda_t (id, tree_id, age_years, height_m, bloom_count, seed_count, prune_month, pest_level, landscape_zone, wood_quality, active)
   - Functions: jacaranda_init, jacaranda_tree_inventory, jacaranda_growth_track, jacaranda_bloom_monitor, jacaranda_seed_collect, jacaranda_prune_schedule, jacaranda_pest_manage, jacaranda_landscape_plant
   - Exports: main (demo: tree inventory, growth tracking, bloom monitoring, seed collection, pruning, pest management, landscape planting)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style (host imports: alloc/print/exit/get_argv, ps/pi helpers, static state, N=16)

2. modules/justicia_admin/src/main.c (Justicia Shrimp Plant Administration)
   - Base ID: 2085
   - Manages justicia (Justicia brandegeeana/shrimp plant) ornamental cultivation
   - Features: plant inventory (16 plants), bract color tracking, flower production monitoring, propagation records (cuttings/division), watering schedule, light exposure tracking, indoor/outdoor placement, seasonal care calendar
   - Domain structs: justicia_t (id, plant_id, age_months, bract_color, flower_count, propagate_type, water_freq, light_level, placement, care_month, active)
   - Functions: justicia_init, justicia_plant_inventory, justicia_bract_track, justicia_flower_monitor, justicia_propagate, justicia_water_schedule, justicia_light_track, justicia_seasonal_care
   - Exports: main (demo: plant inventory, bract tracking, flower monitoring, propagation, watering, light tracking, seasonal care)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

3. modules/kniphofia_admin/src/main.c (Kniphofia Red Hot Poker Administration)
   - Base ID: 2086
   - Manages kniphofia (Kniphofia uvaria/red hot poker) ornamental perennial cultivation
   - Features: clump inventory (16 clumps), flower spike tracking, color variety catalog, division/propagation records, drought tolerance monitoring, pollinator attraction records, landscape design integration, cut flower production
   - Domain structs: kniphofia_t (id, clump_id, age_years, spike_count, color_variety, divide_year, drought_rating, pollinator_count, design_zone, cut_flower_kg, active)
   - Functions: kniphofia_init, kniphofia_clump_inventory, kniphofia_spike_track, kniphofia_color_catalog, kniphofia_divide_propagate, kniphofia_drought_monitor, kniphofia_pollinator_track, kniphofia_cut_flower_harvest
   - Exports: main (demo: clump inventory, spike tracking, color catalog, division propagation, drought monitoring, pollinator tracking, cut flower harvest)
   - Pattern: follow modules/abelia_admin/src/main.c style

Build all 3 modules with:
  clang --target=wasm32-unknown-unknown -Oz -nostdlib -fno-builtin -Wl,--no-entry -Wl,--export=main -o modules/<name>/<name>.wasm modules/<name>/src/main.c

